  m_text: "A massive wall of slime built for pure endurance. It crawls forward at
    a slow, steady pace, soaking up huge amounts of damage before bursting. When
    this one appears, defenses need real power \u2014 or it will simply outlast everything."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
